{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n賴慰玲（Winki）在TVB節目《玩住學。學住玩》中為兒子可謂豁出去！一向極度畏水的她，為了滿足囝囝也也的期待，竟一反常態「搵命搏」挑戰激流划船。在驚濤駭浪中，Winki更要分心為兒子拍照，場面驚險萬分，她最終能否克服心理障礙？\n</p>\n<h2>Winki為親子樂搵命搏 畏水媽媽挑戰激流</h2>\n<p>在23日播出的TVB節目《玩住學。學住玩》中，賴慰玲與囝囝也也結束馬布島3日2夜的行程後，回到沙巴市區重投城市懷抱。旅程中最令也也期待的，便是刺激的激流划船活動，然而這對Winki來說卻是個極大挑戰，皆因她一向「忌水連游水都驚」。不過，為了珍貴的親子樂時光，Winki決定豁出去，為兒子「搵命搏」，身體力行示範迎難而上的決心，母愛相當偉大。</p>\n<h2>激流中充當攝影師 Winki驚險過程全直擊</h2>\n<p>挑戰激流的過程驚險萬分，Winki除了要面對內心的恐懼和湍急的水流，更肩負起另一項艱鉅任務。從預告片段可見，即使在搖晃不定的船上，她仍不忘充當攝影師，為囝囝也也拍攝珍貴照片，一心多用的情況令人既佩服又為她捏一把汗。究竟Winki在激流上如何克服巨大的心理障礙，又經歷了怎樣的驚險歷程，絕對是今集的一大看點。</p>\n<h2>母子裝著娘惹服打卡 品嚐地道肉骨茶</h2>\n<p>在進行刺激的激流挑戰前，Winki和也也先在沙巴市區享受了悠閒的時光。二人精心挑選了大馬傳統服飾「娘惹服」，以溫馨可愛的母子裝造型在街頭拍照留念，畫面充滿愛。隨後，他們更走到街邊檔品嚐地道的肉骨茶，大快朵頤，為接下來的「搵命搏」活動儲備體力，完美展示了旅程中動靜皆宜的一面。</p>\n<h2>網民預告洗版力撐：呢個媽媽太偉大</h2>\n<p>節目預告播出後，Winki為兒子挑戰極限的舉動已引來網民熱烈討論，不少人被她的母愛深深感動，紛紛留言表示期待。網民洗版力撐：「Winki真係好錫個仔！自己驚水都肯為個仔去玩激流，好偉大！」、「睇預告都覺得好驚險，仲要幫個仔影相，媽媽真係無所不能。」、「好期待睇呢集，想睇Winki點樣克服恐懼！」、「為咗仔女，父母真係可以變得好勇敢，好感動。」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20_14652834696ad99964a233d.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20_14652834696ad99964a233d.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/21_5956703386ad9996de4bfd.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/21_5956703386ad9996de4bfd.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/22_696480996ad99979a2c1c.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/22_696480996ad99979a2c1c.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/11_3658241196ad998e7cc8c5.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/11_3658241196ad998e7cc8c5.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/12_12066555336ad998f33e37f.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/12_12066555336ad998f33e37f.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/13_9824969986ad998fd24625.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/13_9824969986ad998fd24625.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/14_11674206496ad999073fbe2.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/14_11674206496ad999073fbe2.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/15_5483271946ad9991616ecd.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/15_5483271946ad9991616ecd.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/16_10714946856ad99921c0472.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/16_10714946856ad99921c0472.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17_14735336586ad999355de92.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17_14735336586ad999355de92.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/18_18885541966ad9995139549.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/18_18885541966ad9995139549.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/19_20035817426ad9995883d67.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/19_20035817426ad9995883d67.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T09:21:08.467628+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1175,"images":12,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T08:58:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T09:18:24.463596+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T09:18:24.463596+00:00","content_hash":"ff791480289c8d7ff59f7b0587604c615200f094ff3faa33b09777219f5f1519","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}